RakuOS Shell Picker
===================

The program is GPL-3.0 (see LICENSE). The artwork under `assets/` comes from the
shells it shows, and keeps their licence:

  assets/noctalia.svg, assets/danklogo2.svg, assets/caelestia.svg,
  assets/ambxst-logo-color.svg, assets/inir.svg
      From the respective upstream projects.

  assets/end4pc.svg
      From pctrade/end4-pC (GPL-3.0).

  assets/nandoroid.svg
      From na-ive/nandoroid-shell, `assets/icons/NAnDoroid.svg` (GPL-3.0).

  assets/sekaipop.svg
      Cropped from Blapples/SekaiPop's `assets/banner.svg` (GPL-3.0).

  assets/impasto.svg
      The palette mark supplied by the RakuOS desktop's author, embedded as a
      PNG inside an SVG frame so the picker needs no separate image file.

The previews under `assets/previews/` are screenshots of the shells, published by
their projects under the same licences.
